message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the associated work. Citation is appreciated, not required by the license.
title: "Reward-Driven Point Selection for One-Shot Segmentation with SAM"
abstract: >-
  Source code for behavioral cloning and proximal policy optimization point
  selection with a frozen Segment Anything Model. Results and learned weights
  are distributed separately at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24226833.
